CD9iCmBfkd8Q7kNvwFynRLR&_nc_oc=Adr5ehUY-XFo5saKQXK3jjRlUxbITxMPlUXib7iHTFJfDs6lHrFcNEjTsNiC1BVSrYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9MTAc4EptodZzaEzKO8BqINW31AJS9hwyK843kIbNTtQ&oe=6A4520B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VKiE7dvSQTAQ7kNvwGbCDlG&_nc_oc=Adot9pwjDfBdUMbit0KVJbAMLHC-P9JSgLuXuUY3HnTWNj1zM59wLHvH5HxgzQnTdrY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8mXm5X_IGUIdNNU1j8mWH8QE9JnQgHLsyUi-y6_wtuQw&oe=6A45224A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dx6HI7rwpeQQ7kNvwFAGndR&_nc_oc=Ado0aBW6iKTL8phH0pLBrxnaeRKepenzd796Ol1k1f_wRca0Ii1Q72G14jp6oCJP_i4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_V0yFkx317QIaHhEHVWXqEhcZkVRYn7NsGdOTRpwuRpQ&oe=6A450F6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j2NmK1ojBdMQ7kNvwGWrlGd&_nc_oc=AdrjMaw77h_cgqod0hQA750Ys4aSCdL4n4YnWGpf5ODNnjoX9jxLodiHXsxbyoK1WNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af85rbzBJuonS-sGoJHqeicqvfEl9Nh7smlntGRy2Fh-WA&oe=6A453103"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mYufctkEPrwQ7kNvwEKQx_g&_nc_oc=Ado17v3-krzoqYu_-r7eAoDh9lxxEfbtX4FowSeuWNRN8PJ6guKqYCYJS7Huc7rJwyU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-UTcPehkAVmLnpZkUvb7-hidB1rfRQ4GJepO7-iFfsVg&oe=6A452958"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gih_1Cn0vTAQ7kNvwEg6onk&_nc_oc=Adoqg1gGCdIOh-pj-Y__GQ-kgn_r1X2F0-Yij_Z-ABICBgb5_fXnKNyxUmSo0yzNSJY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-7_hO7beqIEV0yhYPzbrdokuDZAwR92gm2LtO9aHWMcA&oe=6A45043C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080